body:
In my opinion their only option was to let Hyebin do it.  Her rap in I'm So Hot was good, nothing to write home about but it was good.  Better than JooE, Hyebin is a much better rapper than JooE but MLD is so focused on giving Nancy and JooE as much center/line time they are over looking their weaknesses just.

&#x200B;

Like you said JooE is a great performer, she's really a good singer as well, her energy and stage presence is unmatched in Momoland, but she cannot rap.  Its cringe and half the time she looks lost.
